   "Inventory shows 9 ball plates (6039479): 4 leg balls and 1 head ball on the body (b15, b16, b20, b21, b24), and 4 in the foot repeat. Front legs go on b15/b16, back legs on b20/b21.",
   "Back legs and front legs are built as mirror pairs (copy 2 mirrored). Feet attach to the bottom clip plate of each leg through attach overrides.",
   "Catalogue types lego-362301 (as the 1x3 plate), lego-4140583 (hinge-finger plate) and lego-6043656 (clip plate) were reused despite slightly different catalogue names. In the front leg, the position of the inverted slope 4121932 is uncertain.",
